---
import { PUBLIC_EMAIL } from '../../config/site';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Syncareer LLM Reliability Case Study | Stephen Mensah';
const description = 'How Stephen Mensah identified and responded to formatting, context and response-structure problems in Syncareer.';
---

<BaseLayout {title} {description}>
  <article class="case-page">
    <header class="case-hero page-shell">
      <a class="back-link" href="/#syncareer">← Back to selected work</a>
      <p class="technical-label">Case study / Syncareer</p>
      <h1>Engineering around real LLM failure modes.</h1>
      <p class="case-summary">
        Syncareer is an AI-integrated career platform built by Stephen. When its LLM-powered features
        were used in production, the output did not always behave as the product expected.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="case-content page-shell">
      <section aria-labelledby="context-title">
        <p class="section-label">Context</p>
        <h2 id="context-title">The demo was not the full test.</h2>
        <p>Syncareer's AI features worked in the demo. Production use exposed problems that had not been clear earlier.</p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="observed-title">
        <p class="section-label">Confirmed observations</p>
        <h2 id="observed-title">What started breaking</h2>
        <ul class="evidence-list">
          <li>Output formatting was inconsistent.</li>
          <li>Relevant context was dropped.</li>
          <li>The response structure was unpredictable.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="changed-title">
        <p class="section-label">Implemented changes</p>
        <h2 id="changed-title">What I changed</h2>
        <ul class="evidence-list">
          <li>Restructured prompts.</li>
          <li>Added few-shot examples to anchor the expected structure.</li>
          <li>Managed context explicitly.</li>
          <li>Set clearer constraints around the expected output.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="learned-title">
        <p class="section-label">Interpretation</p>
        <h2 id="learned-title">What I learned</h2>
        <p>
          These were not one general “AI problem.” Formatting, retained context and response structure
          broke in different ways. Each change needed to address a specific behaviour I had observed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section aria-labelledby="unresolved-title">
        <p class="section-label">Evidence boundary</p>
        <h2 id="unresolved-title">What remains unresolved</h2>
        <p>
          This case study does not yet include before-and-after outputs, a repeatable evaluation or a
          measured failure rate. It therefore does not claim that the system reached a quantified reliability threshold.
        </p>
        <!-- Add real inputs, outputs, evaluation details, architecture and remaining limitations when supplied. -->
      </section>

      <section class="contact-section" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
        <p class="section-label">Contact</p>
        <h2 id="contact-title">Want to talk through the engineering?</h2>
        <a class="button" href={`mailto:${PUBLIC_EMAIL}`}>Email Stephen</a>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .case-page {
    border-bottom: var(--border-default);
  }

  .case-hero {
    padding-block: clamp(var(--space-8), 10vw, var(--space-10));
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: var(--control-height);
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--text-small);
  }

  .case-hero h1 {
    max-width: 15ch;
    margin-block: var(--space-5);
    font-size: var(--text-h1);
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .case-summary {
    max-width: var(--width-reading);
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--text-body-large);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .case-content {
    max-width: calc(var(--width-content) + (2 * var(--page-gutter)));
    padding-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .case-content section {
    padding-block: var(--space-8);
    border-top: var(--border-default);
  }

  .section-label {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-label);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .case-content h2 {
    max-width: 20ch;
    margin-block: var(--space-3) var(--space-5);
    font-size: var(--text-h2);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .case-content section > p:not(.section-label) {
    max-width: var(--width-reading);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .evidence-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    max-width: var(--width-reading);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .evidence-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
  }

  .evidence-list li::before {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    content: '—';
  }

  .contact-section .button {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }
</style>
